---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Zero Image Retention Guarantee | Font Finder"
  description="Read Font Finder's clear privacy policy. We never store, log, or share your uploaded images. Image processing happens strictly in-memory."
>
  <article class="py-12 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs font-medium mb-4">
        <span>Privacy First Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-foreground tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        Last revised: March 2026. How we treat your images, data, and privacy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight">
          1. Uploaded Images & Zero Retention
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you drag, drop, or paste an image or screenshot into Font Finder:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>The image is loaded into your browser's local HTML5 Canvas memory.</li>
          <li>Pixel values are measured strictly during your active session.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-foreground">Your image is never written to disk, saved into a database, or transmitted to any third party.</strong></li>
          <li>When you click "New Image", "Scan Another", or close the browser tab, the image memory is purged immediately.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight">
          2. No AI Model Training On Your Data
        </h2>
        <p>
          We do not feed, train, or store user screenshots in any AI training corpus. Font Finder uses direct mathematical letterform analysis (geometric contours, contrast ratios, and terminal measurements).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight">
          3. Tracking & Cookies
        </h2>
        <p>
          Font Finder does not use intrusive marketing cookies, profiling trackers, or third-party advertising networks.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use browser <code>localStorage</code> solely to remember your Dark/Light theme preference between visits. No personal identifiers or browsing histories are retained.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight">
          4. External Links
        </h2>
        <p>
          When you click "Open in Google Fonts", you navigate to Google's official specimen repository (fonts.google.com), which operates under Google's standard privacy guidelines.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground tracking-tight">
          5. Contact Us
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this privacy policy, please reach out via our open-source project repository.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
